# oracle: dump vtk XML PolyData file (.vtp) with id type vx vy vz fx fy fz and the RectilinearGrid bounding box (.vtr), 4x4x4 fcc lj
# oracle-files: dump0.vtp dump10.vtp dump20.vtp dump0_boundingBox.vtr dump20_boundingBox.vtr
# oracle-compare: filerel=1e-7
# Measured with native LAMMPS: max relative error 0 on values above 1e-6 in all five files (PolyData at steps 0, 10, 20 and the RectilinearGrid boxes); the largest absolute difference is 3.9e-15. Native build: /home/roy/.local/bin/lmp (b332f28). Engine time about 0.5 s.
units           lj
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 1.0
velocity        all create 1.44 87287 loop geom
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
fix             1 all nve
dump            d all vtk 10 dump*.vtp id type vx vy vz fx fy fz
thermo_style    custom step pe
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             20
